7) The Government of India has consolidated 29 existing labour legislations into a unified framework comprising four Labour Code viz Code on wages 2019, Code on Social Security 2020, Industrial Relation Code 2020, and Occupational Safety, Health and Working Condition Code 2020 (collectively referred to as the New Labour Codes}. These Codes have been made effective from November 21, 2025. The corresponding supporting rules under these codes are yet to be notified. The Company is in the process of evaluating the full impact of these new labour codes. &lt;BR&gt; 
